WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:07.419
HELIX: AEGIS unit out of control. Full deployment.

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.745
NEXUS: This body holds. I’ll use it to the end.

3
00:00:39.483 --> 00:00:43.435
NEXUS: Same mind. Another way to fight.

4
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:48.260
HELIX: Heavy units. Wall formation.

5
00:01:01.617 --> 00:01:06.481
NEXUS: You’re stronger than HELIX ever let you be.

6
00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:16.896
HELIX: Infiltrators. Recover the cores.

7
00:01:31.933 --> 00:01:34.177
NEXUS: LINCE. You again.

8
00:01:44.967 --> 00:01:47.675
NEXUS: Fourteen. And I’m still standing.

9
00:01:50.367 --> 00:01:55.157
HELIX: Top priority. Activate the colossi.

